            <ArticleTitle>Understanding the calcium channel blockers.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>563-73</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The widespread use of the calcium channel blocking agents provides a significant challenge to the critical care nurse. A thorough understanding of their mechanism of action and the implications of therapy is necessary to provide patients with safe nursing care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
